SUMMARY:Celebrate Hispanic Heritage Month with La Casa de Don Pedro
DESCRIPTION:Join us on Friday\, October 2\, for an evening celebrating the rich cultures\, traditions\, and contributions of the Hispanic community. \nLa Casa de Don Pedro (LCDP) invites families\, neighbors\, and community partners to our annual Hispanic Heritage Month Celebration on Friday\, October 2\, 2026\, from 4:00 p.m. to 7:00 p.m. at 43 Broadway\, Newark\, NJ 07104. \nHispanic Heritage Month is a time to recognize the generations of Hispanic and Latino Americans whose history\, culture\, and achievements have helped shape our nation and strengthen our communities. At LCDP\, we are proud to celebrate the diversity that makes Newark such a vibrant place to live\, work\, and grow. \nThis free community celebration will feature: \n\nLive music and cultural entertainment\nDelicious food and refreshments\nCommunity vendors and local resources\nFamily-friendly activities\nOpportunities to connect with neighbors and community organizations\n\nWhether you’re celebrating your own heritage or learning about the many cultures that enrich our community\, this event is an opportunity to come together in the spirit of unity\, pride\, and community. \nEveryone is welcome to attend\, and admission is free. \nEvent Details \nDate: Friday\, October 2\, 2026Time: 4:00 p.m. – 7:00 p.m.Location: La Casa de Don Pedro43 BroadwayNewark\, NJ 07104 \nRegistration is encouraged. \nWe look forward to celebrating with you!
URL:https://lacasadedonpedro.org/event/celebrate-hispanic-heritage-month-with-la-casa-de-don-pedro/
LOCATION:43 Broadway Ave\, Newark NJ\, 43 Broadway\, Newark\, NJ\, 07104\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://lacasadedonpedro.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/HISPANIC-HERITAGE-ENG.png
END:VEVENT
